      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `816c0eafe74c2bb81173d33e6e57ba062d6d0593b1eb883dc70dfc1807e5dfe4--1.-Victims-of-crime-Australia-Tables-1-to-8-.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Victims (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2022\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 9 of 9\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 5c9712a5570a172dece38e768b326200b389edde3ec39644ee9c1fdb6da8f6f5 | missing |\n| \"Table 1\" | 16e9410f298e1bfdbb8abc2ae00ee44080340e6e758a7e6308feb98ee1a52b14 | missing |\n| \"Table 2\" | f8212ba451050e161c0472c8044e7e847507e98f510a3f361994e171c9f3eba8 | missing |\n| \"Table 3\" | ba1c65bc0c9a22c8d9af032b36543eb90f89f78707bcf3d13c097c7afe0f917c | missing |\n| \"Table 4\" | 6b7281e7c32750dbabf194914b8a242216a3bdaf75e8ca1599c86e6e2beb8353 | missing |\n| \"Table 5\" | df7db2716724e4ab060ba999ab014f2d87f6d20b94e1f9a957f4d6b61d444a64 | missing |\n| \"Table 6\" | e871d06ec90621ca55554f78786d4cab3d80606c4d2c959d59e63e5f657dbce8 | missing |\n| \"Table 7\" | 8d97e1a45cbfde2823f7ac9aad4eab21d65be0a7a9ba86fb70bd903542b2475b | missing |\n| \"Table 8\" | 2d1742fb6d6576798d200a63b1535ef15b0ffe7643800761b2232e8618854d50 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
